Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:27.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}也曾有勇氣邁出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:30.40,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}無論無數次碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.20,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}不管跌倒多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:38.15,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}心中堅信一定能抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:54.17,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}始終追尋著那日所見的風景
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:59.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}可只是一味追趕 卻怎麼也追不上
