Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:16.36,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}卻在吶喊「還能繼續努力」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:20.65,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}於是再次堅定地許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.86,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即便如此 也要繼續戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:26.44,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕淚水不再
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:31.71,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即使一切都是錯的
